b.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":50,"created_at":"2025-09-26T15:18:13Z","updated_at":"2026-08-03T11:45:51Z","closed_at":"2026-01-29T18:16:18Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110933","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110933","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110933.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110933.patch","merged_at":"2026-01-29T18:16:18Z"},"body":"Closes [#11192](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11192)\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1198\" height=\"633\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/58e8fa94-097f-4a11-9c39-199883a3f307\" />\r\n\r\nOn mobile games a common shooting input is to drag(flick) the joystick. One example would be Brawl Stars. When I recreated that game I needed those signals:\r\n- Tapped: Emitted when the joystick is released without moving the tip.\r\n- Released: Emitted when the joystick is released.\r\n- Flicked: Emitted when the tip moved outside the deadzone and the joystick is released.\r\n- Flick_canceled: Emitted when the tip enters the deadzone after being outside of it.\r\n\r\nJoystickMode = Fixed:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e57d8c0c-a677-4d0a-b07e-283edd542d80\r\n\r\nJoystickMode = Dynamic:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4f6fe63b-3a45-4006-a2e2-e0b7f4bd8683\r\n\r\nJoystickMode = Follow:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a7d7544c-82c0-4e27-8bbb-7be302556952\r\n\r\nRight now the initial Joystick position is in the center of the Rect. What would be the best way to control that initial position in the inspector?","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110933/reactions","total_count":95,"+1":43,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":21,"confused":1,"heart":19,"rocket":0,"eyes":10},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110933/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}